bpftune (0.4.61) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * swap target: replace hard exclusions with a soft penalty.  A target
    with bad_streak=2 or null_streak=3 is no longer removed from the
    candidate pool; it is down-weighted by 16/(16 + bad*4 + null*2).
    bad=2 -> 0.67x, null=3 -> 0.73x, both -> 0.53x.  A winning swap or a
    rising rate_ema still clears the streaks, and the target can climb
    back automatically.  No state change; STATE_VERSION unchanged at 17.

