bpftune (0.4.60) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * swap_score: asymmetric update.  A win moves the score by 1/16
    (unchanged).  A null pulls it toward neutral 256 by 1/4.  A loss
    pulls it toward the observed ratio by 1/2.  Purpose: a target with
    high historical score can no longer coast through consecutive
    nulls.  Simulated descent from a score of 340: today's rule needs
    ~20 nulls to reach 285; the new rule needs 6-8.
    - Two new constants only; struct and STATE_VERSION unchanged.

