bpftune (0.4.59) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * null_streak: three consecutive null swaps to an algorithm exclude it
    from the target pool.  A null is neither a loss nor a win, but it
    still costs a cwnd reset and proves nothing.  Split from bad_streak
    so loss and null can be tuned independently.

    - tcp_conn_metric: null_streak (u8), replaces the _pad0 slot
      (struct size unchanged)
    - score_pending_swap: ratio >= 1.1 clears both streaks; <= 0.9
      increments bad_streak; between, increments null_streak
    - rate_ema rising on a normal vote clears both
    - pass-3 excludes on bad_streak >= 2 or null_streak >= 3
