bpftune (0.4.54) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * three changes to reduce wasted swaps and fix the trigger operands.

    1. MIN_LEADER_TRUST 3 -> 10.  Only 22 of ~150 buckets on the fleet
       ever reach 10 votes on ANY algorithm.  A trusted leader from 3
       samples is noise.
    2. exploring protection.  set_cong() marks a socket exploring when
       the assigned alg is neither the metric nor the rate leader.
       Vote path counts votes on that alg; swap chain skips until
       EXPLORE_PROTECT_VOTES (3) votes are cast.  Prior behavior
       allowed swap after 1 vote, so exploration contributed one
       sample per event.
    3. trigger operands composite -> rate.  margin_met and desperate
       compare last_rate_bps against rate_best_v, not last_metric
       against best_alt.  Old composite thresholds 1.5x / 2.0x become
       rate 66% / 25% of leader.  Over a 30-swap measured sample,
       rate-based tiers scored 74% win / 4% loss while the composite
       tier scored 57% win.

