bpftune (0.4.53) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * new srate companion printk on every vote, alongside midsamp.
    Analysis of 212 swaps on 2026-09-19: 78% had no post-swap
    midsamp and were therefore unmeasurable.  Reason: midsamp
    only fires on rung crossings (1K..1M segs).  Sockets past the
    last rung only vote via the 60s time-check, and the time-check
    path never emitted a raw delivered rate.  So long-lived
    sockets that produced a swap were untrackable.
        srate cookie=N alg=N srate=N
    fires on every vote regardless of which branch triggered it,
    carrying the same rate_delivered * mss * 1e6 / rate_interval_us
    the midsamp line uses.  Log-only; no state change.

