bpftune (0.4.36) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Userspace re-anchor for the tcp_conn_tuner tracker.
    The BPF vote path maintains best_i/best_v incrementally and the
    ESTABLISHED-time rescan refreshes it on new connections, but
    between those events a non-leader metric can drift to a lower
    value without being promoted.  Observed on the home bucket:
    best_i pointed at htcp at 1.79M while dctcp at 608K had n=5 and
